<title>SPAIN: Spain employers say will make no new labour offer.</title>
<headline>Spain employers say will make no new labour offer.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish employer association CEOE's president Jose Maria Cuevas said on Tuesday that employers did not plan to make a new offer in labour reform talks with unions.</p>
</text>
